get_agent=deep-research\",\"newInfoRatio\":0.3,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Retry: re-verify iteration-004 timeline.md design evidence (chronological lineage survival) + repair missing delta artifact\",\"findingsCount\":5,\"noveltyJustification\":\"Confirmation-dominant retry: independently re-confirmed two-source discrepancy (018/033), last_save_at work-bound signals, chrono_id thesis, and timeline.md schema/placement; the only new facts were the 021 git-anchor correction (first-add 07-30, not 08-03) and its anchor-file rule, plus the missing iter-004 delta now repaired.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"KQ4\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"KQ4\"],\"ruledOut\":[],\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Bash\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"git log --all --follow --diff-filter=A (22 spec.md paths)\",\"44 child graph-metadata.json (created_at/last_save_at/status)\",\"specs/system-deep-loop/036-deep-loop-innovation/graph-metadata.json\",\"lineages/ds-a/timeline.md\",\"iteration-004.md\",\"deltas/iter-003.jsonl\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-13T09:48:00Z\",\"durationMs\":90000,\"graphEvents\":[{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"n-timeline-confirmed\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"timeline.md schema/rules/placement independently confirmed\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"n-ts-double-source\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"two-source discrepancy confirmed for 018 & 033; corrected for 021 (git first-add 07-30)\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"n-last-save-work-bound\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"last_save_at work-bound signals confirmed incl. 07-17 backfill cluster\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"n-anchor-rule\",\"kind\":\"CLAIM\",\"label\":\"git_first_add must be anchor-pinned to spec.md (021 anchor ambiguity)\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"s-graph-metadata\",\"kind\":\"SOURCE\",\"label\":\"44 child graph-metadata.json extraction\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"s-git-log\",\"kind\":\"SOURCE\",\"label\":\"git log --all --follow --diff-filter=A per spec.md\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-ts-sourc... (line truncated to 2000 chars)","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0144-system-deep-loop-036-p0-remediation/specs/system-deep-loop/036-deep-loop-innovation/057-phase-consolidation-research/research/lineages/ds-a/deep-research-state.jsonl","text":"{\"type\":\"config\",\"topic\":\"Analyze the 036 phase-parent (specs/system-deep-loop/036-deep-loop-innovation) child phase folders (currently ~50, matching ^[0-9]{3}-). Determine (1) whether merging/grouping them into fewer, larger multi-phase groups is feasible and beneficial for context optimization; (2) HOW - which child folders cluster into which fewer bigger multi-phase parents, by theme/dependency, with optimized names; (3) the full migration plan - renaming, and updating ALL references and JSONs (parent+child graph-metadata children_ids, spec.md phase documentation map, cross-refs, description.json, validate.sh manifest); (4) CRITICAL - a timeline.md design that records which spec folder was worked on first and which came after, so the chronological lineage survives any renumbering (derive order from git history and graph-metadata created/updated timestamps). Ground every proposed grouping in the actual on-disk folders and their metadata; this is research/proposal only - do not restructure anything.\",\"maxIterations\":5,\"convergenceThreshold\":0.05,\"stuckThreshold\":3,\"specFolder\":\"specs/system-deep-loop/036-deep-loop-innovation/057-phase-consolidation-research\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-13T09:10:00Z\"}\n{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"run\":1,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Full on-disk census of 44 child phase folders + metadata surfaces\",\"findingsCount\":10,\"newInfoRatio\":1.0,\"noveltyJustification\":\"First pass; validated children_ids vs disk, discovered hardcoded validate.sh manifest (40/44 covered), phase-tree.json, descriptions.json index, and git first-add chronology.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"KQ1\",\"KQ2\",\"KQ3\",\"KQ4\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[],\"ruledOut\":[{\"approach\":\"Full-repo git log --diff-filter=A\",\"reason\":\"Timed out (>120s); too large\",\"evidence\":\"bash git log\"},{\"approach\":\"git log without --follow\",\"reason\":\"Returns nothing because specs/ path was flipped from .opencode/specs at 606e55cb8a9\",\"evidence\":\"git log <path>\"}],\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-13T09:12:00Z\",\"durationMs\":180000}\n{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"run\":2,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Theme/dependency clustering into candidate multi-phase groups\",\"findingsCount\":6,\"newInfoRatio\":0.75,\"noveltyJustification\":\"Proposed 5/7-group consolidation shape, E-split refinement, naming-collision hazard with inner 0NN numbering, and phase-tree.json 17-vs-44 coverage gap.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"KQ1\",\"KQ2\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"KQ2\"],\"ruledOut\":[{\"approach\":\"Flat 5-group split treating all 44 as equal leaves\",\"reason\":\"13 children are already phase parents; remediation wave is not a dependency spine\",\"evidence\":\"iteration-002.md\"}],\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-13T09:16:00Z\",\"durationMs\":120000}\n{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"run\":3,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Full migration plan: rename mapping + every reference surface\",\"findingsCount\":5,\"newInfoRatio\":0.9,\"noveltyJustification\":\"Produced 44-row old→new mapping, 15-surface migration checklist incl. validate.sh embedded hash + vitest lockstep + 98-file sweep + memory re-ingest, and recommended execution order.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"KQ3\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"KQ3\"],\"ruledOut\":[{\"approach\":\"Option 2: flat renumber with no group parents\",\"reason\":\"No context-optimization gain; still 44 top-level entries\",\"evidence\":\"iteration-003.md\"}],\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-13T09:20:00Z\",\"durationMs\":130000}\n{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"run\":4,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"timeline.md design for chronological lineage survival\",\"findingsCount\":5,\"newInfoRatio\":0.85,\"noveltyJustification\":\"Established two-source timestamp discrepancy, selected last_save_at as work-bound signal, defined timeline.md schema/rules/placement, produced full 44-folder worked-order table.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"KQ4\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"KQ4\"],\"ruledOut\":[{\"approach\":\"Relying on folder number or a single timestamp source as chronological order\",\"reason\":\"Numbering does not match work order in 02x-05x range; created_at and git first-add disagree\",\"evidence\":\"iteration-004.md\"}],\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-13T09:24:00Z\",\"durationMs\":100000}\n{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"run\":5,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Feasibility verdict (KQ1) + synthesis input\",\"findingsCount\":7,\"newInfoRatio\":0.55,\"noveltyJustification\":\"Delivered feasibility verdict with scope-specific benefit, surfaced legacy .opencode/specs path refs in runtime code/tests, confirmed three pre-existing staleness bugs, stated safe-do conditions.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"KQ1\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"KQ1\",\"KQ2\",\"KQ3\",\"KQ4\"],\"ruledOut\":[{\"approach\":\"Single flat consolidation of all 44 into one level\",\"reason\":\"Zero context win, same migration cost\",\"evidence\":\"iteration-005.md\"}],\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-13T09:28:00Z\",\"durationMs\":90000}\n{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"synthesis_complete\",\"totalIterations\":5,\"answeredCount\":4,\"totalQuestions\":4,\"stopReason\":\"maxIterationsReached\"}\n{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":1,\"run\":1,\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"newInfoRatio\":0.25,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Retry: re-verify iteration-001 census evidence + repair missing delta artifact\",\"findingsCount\":5,\"noveltyJustification\":\"Confirmation-dominant retry: re-derived on-disk census (44 children) and validate.sh 40/44 embedded-manifest hash; only structural new item was the missing iter-001 delta